<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">Dear Mr. Hassen:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">This letter agreement (the &ldquo;<B>Agreement</B>&rdquo;)
constitutes the agreement between Curvature Securities, LLC (&ldquo;<B>Curvature</B>&rdquo;), as placement agent (the &ldquo;<B>Placement
Agent</B>&rdquo;) and CleanCore Solutions, Inc., a company incorporated under the laws of the State of Nevada (the &ldquo;<B>Company</B>&rdquo;),
pursuant to which the Placement Agent shall serve as the exclusive placement agent for the Company, on a &ldquo;reasonable best efforts&rdquo;
basis, in connection with the proposed placement (the &ldquo;<B>Placement</B>&rdquo;) of shares of Class B common stock (the &ldquo;<B>Shares</B>&rdquo;)
of the Company, par value $0.0001 per share (&ldquo;<B>Common Stock</B>&rdquo;), pre-funded warrants to purchase shares of Common Stock
(the &ldquo;<B>Pre-Funded Warrants</B>&rdquo;), and common warrants to purchase shares of Common Stock (the &ldquo;<B>Common Warrants</B>&rdquo;
and, together with the Shares and the Pre-Funded Warrants, the &ldquo;<B>Securities</B>&rdquo;). The parties acknowledge that the Placement
may be conducted as a confidentially marketed public offering. The terms of the Placement and the Securities shall be mutually agreed
upon by the Company and the purchasers (each, a &ldquo;<B>Purchaser</B>&rdquo; and, collectively, the &ldquo;<B>Purchasers</B>&rdquo;)
and nothing herein constitutes that the Placement Agent would have the power or authority to bind the Company or any Purchaser or an obligation
for the Company to issue any Securities or complete the Placement. This Agreement and the documents executed and delivered by the Company
and the Purchasers in connection with the Placement, which may include a securities purchase agreement between the Company and one or
more of such Purchasers in a form mutually agreed upon by the Company and the Placement Agent (the &ldquo;<B>Purchase Agreement</B>&rdquo;).
The parties acknowledge that Securities may be sold in the Placement either pursuant to a Purchase Agreement executed by the applicable
Purchaser or directly pursuant to the Prospectus Supplement without execution of a Purchase Agreement by such investor. The Company and
the Placement Agent may establish minimum investment thresholds applicable to investors participating in the Placement. This Agreement,
any Purchase Agreement and the other documents executed and delivered in connection with the Placement shall be collectively referred
to herein as the &ldquo;<B>Transaction Documents</B>.&rdquo; The date on which the terms of the Placement, including the purchase price
of the Securities, are established shall be referred to herein as the &ldquo;<B>Pricing Date</B>.&rdquo; The date of the closing of the
Placement shall be referred to herein as the &ldquo;<B>Closing Date</B>.&rdquo; The Company expressly acknowledges and agrees that the
Placement Agent&rsquo;s obligations hereunder are on a reasonable best efforts basis only and that the execution of this Agreement does
not constitute a commitment by the Placement Agent to purchase the Securities and does not ensure the successful placement of the Securities
or any portion thereof or the success of the Placement Agent with respect to securing any other financing on behalf of the Company. With
the prior written consent of the Company, the Placement Agent may retain other brokers or dealers to act as sub-agents or selected-dealers
on its behalf in connection with the Placement. Capitalized terms that are not otherwise defined herein have the meanings given to such
terms in the Purchase Agreement. Prior to the signing of any Purchase Agreement, executive officers of the Company will be available upon
reasonable notice and during normal business hours to answer inquiries from prospective Purchasers.</P>

